Faithful servant to the master of the Velvet Room, {{A}}. As part of her master's orders, she acts as Nagisa's personal concierge to oversee the strengthening of his desire, and offers support to the Phantom Thieves from the sidelines.=Sirviente fiel del maestro de la Habitación Terciopelo, {{A}}.\nComo parte de sus órdenes, actúa como conserje personal de Nagisa para supervisar el fortalecimiento de su deseo y ofrece apoyo a los Ladrones Fantasma desde las sombras.
Under orders from {{A}}, {{B}} is tasked with finding a way to support Nagisa in the real world. A chance encounter leads to her arriving upon a rather unconventional solution...=Por órdenes de {{A}}, {{B}} tiene la tarea de encontrar una forma de apoyar a Nagisa en el mundo real.\nUn encuentro fortuito la lleva a una solución poco convencional...
As Nagisa's concierge, {{A}} must come up with an effective way to support him. She proposes a special contract, through which she hopes to better understand him.=Como conserje de Nagisa, {{A}} debe idear una forma efectiva de apoyarlo.\nPropone un contrato especial, mediante el cual espera comprenderlo mejor.
