<color\=#FFD145>???</color>, <color\=#FFD145>???</color>, and <color\=#FFD145>???</color>'s Synergy can be raised to Rank 3.=La sinergia de <color\=#FFD145>???</color>, <color\=#FFD145>???</color> y <color\=#FFD145>???</color> puede subirse al rango 3.
