It's raining today. I'll be able to concentrate on studying at home...=Está lloviendo hoy.\nPodré concentrarme en estudiar en casa...
Hoo! Your pen hasn't stopped moving!\nYour rapid progress is nothing short\nof incredible.=¡Hoo!\n¡Tu pluma no ha dejado de moverse!\nTu progreso es simplemente increíble.
Hoo hoo! You made it this far already?=¡Hoo hoo!\n¿Ya llegaste tan lejos?
It seems you are truly in the zone today.=Parece que hoy estás realmente concentrado.
