Thank you for playing Persona5: The Phantom X.\n\nJuly 11 is {{A}} Kano's birthday!\nWe're sending you one of his favorite things.\nWhen spending time with {{A}} during City Life activities, you can give it to him as a gift to raise your Synergy.\nSo hand him his present and see what happens!\n\nWe hope you continue to enjoy Persona5: The Phantom X.=Gracias por jugar Persona5: The Phantom X.\n\n\n¡El 11 de julio es el cumpleaños de {{A}} Kano!\nTe enviamos una de sus cosas favoritas.\nAl pasar tiempo con {{A}} durante las actividades de la vida urbana, puede dárselo como un regalo para elevar su sinergia.\n¡Así que dale su regalo y mira qué pasa!\n\n\nEsperamos que continúe disfrutando de Persona5: The Phantom X.
Birthday Gift for {{A}} Kano=Regalo de cumpleaños para {{A}} Kano
