Hoom, greetings. You're quite congenial for\nthe morning. Sorry to pester you first thing,\nbut I have something to report.=Hoom, saludos.\nEres bastante agradable para la mañana.\nLamento molestarlo, pero tengo algo que informar.
If this is to be our <color\=#FF423F>base of operations</color> for\nnurturing hope, I would prefer it have a\nsplash of color...=Si esta va a ser nuestra <color\=#FF423F>base de operaciones</color> Para nutrir la esperanza, preferiría que tenga un toque de color...
