A story about a quiet, kindhearted schoolgirl who seeks true love while resisting the hands of fate.\nFor those seeking a heartwarming school romance story.=Una historia sobre una colegiala tranquila y bondadosa que busca el amor verdadero mientras desafía al destino.\nIdeal para quienes buscan un romance escolar conmovedor.
A book for those who want to acquire charisma.\nWith just this book, even you can become popular! Probably...=Un libro para quienes desean adquirir carisma.\n¡Con solo este libro, hasta tú podrías volverte popular! Probablemente...
A story about a genius physicist who falls in love with a struggling single mother, and how he covers up her criminal deeds.\nA novel that will move your heart.=Una historia sobre un físico brillante que se enamora de una madre soltera con dificultades, y encubre sus actos criminales.\nUna novela que tocará tu corazón.
A book that examines the prevalence of a lack of desire among residents of developed countries.\nFor those who wish to deepen their understanding of social issues.=Un libro que analiza la falta de deseo en los habitantes de países desarrollados.\nPara quienes desean profundizar en temas sociales.
A story about a high school girl who has been tormented by her classmates awakens to her powers as a witch and seeks revenge.\nJust reading it seems to give you the courage to resist.=Una historia sobre una chica de secundaria atormentada por sus compañeros, que despierta como bruja y busca venganza.\nSolo leerla parece darte el valor para resistir.
