Countless traps await the Phantom Thieves on their path to the Core.\nThey must combine their power in order to overcome the difficulties that lie ahead.=Incontables trampas esperan a los Ladrones Fantasma en su camino hacia el núcleo.\nDeben combinar su poder para superar las dificultades que les esperan.
