Are you okay? Don't push\nyourself so hard...=¿Estás bien? No te esfuerces tanto...
One of the 72 demons of the Goetia, he is known as the President of Hell. He can shape-shift from leopard to human and reveal the truth behind divine mysteries.=Uno de los 72 demonios de la Goetia, es conocido como el Presidente del Infierno. Puede transformarse de leopardo a humano y revelar la verdad que se oculta tras los misterios divinos.
A Canaanite god of fire. A bronze statue of a man with a bull's head stands at his altar. The statue was heated and sacrificial children were thrown inside.=Dios cananeo del fuego. En su altar hay una estatua de bronce de un hombre con cabeza de toro. La estatua se calentaba y en su interior se arrojaban niños para el sacrificio.
