They were having a sale on lucky bags, so I\njust bought as many as I could, but maybe I\ngot too many...=Estaban de rebajas en las bolsas de la suerte, así que compré todas las que pude, pero quizá compré demasiadas...
You there! Would you be interested in buying\none of these?=¡Ustedes! ¿Estaría interesado en comprar uno de estos?
Both of them are still sealed, so even I\ndon't know what's in them.=Ambos siguen precintados, así que ni siquiera yo sé lo que contienen.
Pick whichever one you like!\nPlease, I insist!=¡Elige el que quieras! ¡Por favor, insisto!
I don't have any money.=No tengo dinero.
