The Hindu king of birds. In the Ramayana, he fought bravely against Ravana in an attempt to save Sita, Rama's wife and the seventh avatar of Vishnu, but lost.=El rey hindú de los pájaros. En el Ramayana, luchó valientemente contra Ravana en un intento de salvar a Sita, esposa de Rama y séptimo avatar de Visnú, pero perdió.
A giant snake with eight heads that Susano-o defeated to save Kushinada-hime. The legendary sword Ame-no-Murakumo-no-Tsurugi, also known as the "Sword of Kusanagi," emerged from its belly.=Una serpiente gigante de ocho cabezas a la que Susano-o derrotó para salvar a Kushinada-hime. De su vientre surgió la legendaria espada Ame-no-Murakumo-no-Tsurugi, también conocida como la "Espada de Kusanagi".
