A giant elephant monster of Sri Lankan myth, it is typically portrayed as being ridden by the Evil One, Mara. Whoever looks into its evil eye is said to be met with misfortune.=Monstruo elefante gigante del mito de Sri Lanka, suele aparecer montado por el Maligno, Mara. Se dice que quien mira a su ojo maligno se encuentra con la desgracia.
