The Shadows are after the treasure chest!?=¿¡Las Sombras están tras el cofre del tesoro!?
What exactly is going on here?\nLet's investigate.=¿Qué ocurre exactamente? Vamos a investigar.
Misers=Misers
They're attempting to flee!\nHurry and catch them!=¡Están intentando huir! ¡Date prisa y atrápalos!
