Do you want to automatically trade for the remaining seals?\nThis will cost <size\=60><sprite\=34></size>x1825<size\=60><sprite\=35></size>x1000.=¿Quieres intercambiar automáticamente por los sellos restantes?\nEsto costará <size\=60><sprite\=34></size>x1825<size\=60><sprite\=35></size>x1000.
