The method to obtain the tool {{A}} has been unlocked.\nThe method to obtain the music track TRIPLE SEVEN has been unlocked.\n=Se ha desbloqueado el método para obtener la herramienta {{A}}. Se ha desbloqueado el método para obtener la pista musical TRIPLE SEVEN.\n
