Spend: <color\=#FFDE00>Orange Fortune Revelation x1</color>.\nTrade: <color\=#FFDE00>Space Revelation Resolve x1</color>.\nDo you want to confirm?=Gastar: <color\=#FFDE00>Revelación de la Fortuna Naranja x1</color>.\nComercio: <color\=#FFDE00>Revelación Espacial Resolver x1</color>. ¿Quieres confirmarlo?
