Changes the protagonist's appearance to his beachwear.\nCan be obtained by purchasing {{A}}'s Beachwear from the Shop.=Cambia la apariencia del protagonista por su ropa de playa. Se puede obtener comprando la ropa de playa de {{A}} en la Tienda.
Changes {{A}}'s appearance to his Ultramarine Outfit.\nCan be obtained by purchasing the Ultramarine {{A}} Set in the Shop.=Cambia la apariencia de {{A}} a su atuendo Ultramar. Se puede obtener comprando el Conjunto Ultramar de {{A}} en la Tienda.
