Today, we're having whole-roasted burdock\nroot, fried chicken heads, and steamed rice\nwith fermented fish and blue cheese...=Hoy, vamos a tener raíz de bardana asada entera, cabezas de pollo fritas y arroz al vapor con pescado fermentado y queso azul...
