During battle, when SP reaches 100%/150%/200%, increase critical damage by <color\=#2899ff>15%/30%/45%</color>.=Durante el combate, cuando el PE alcance el 100%/150%/200%, aumenta el daño crítico en <color\=#2899ff>15%/30%/45%</color>.
[Season of Brightness]=[Temporada de Brillo]
Now, while they're down!=¡Ahora, mientras están en el suelo!
Increase Nuclear dmg.=Aumenta el daño Nuclear.
