Uh, are you sure? That doesn't sound right.=¿Eh, estás seguro? Eso no suena bien.
Try to remember. You've been observing the\nemployees perform, have you not?=Intenta recordar. Has estado observando a los empleados actuar, ¿no?
What? Seriously? That seems kind of\ntactless...=¿Qué? ¿En serio? Eso suena algo falto de tacto...
You really put the "Sss" in salesman...=De verdad le pones la "Sss" al vendedor...
