Targets with a shield from Jikokuten's Blade of Sanctuary gain 10% increased Attack. Jikokuten's Attack is increased by 10%.=Los objetivos con un escudo de la Blade of Sanctuary de Jikokuten ganan 10 % de Ataque adicional. El Ataque de Jikokuten aumenta un 10 %.
Set to <color\=#FF423F>Berserk</color>.=Activa el <color\=#FF423F>Berserk</color>.
