<color\=#FFC000>Rank 17</color>: Unlock the ability to purchase products from Akihabara using Shady Commodities.=<color\=#FFC000>Rango 17</color>: Desbloquea la habilidad de comprar productos de Akihabara usando Negocios Turbios.
Thank you. I was hoping to talk about my\nfather's former secretary...=Gracias. Quería hablar sobre la exsecretaria de mi padre...
